LOCAL REGULATION OF PEKANBARU CITY

NUMBER YEAR 2023

CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD THE MAYOR OF PEKANBARU,

a. that the fulfillment of basic rights or constitutional rights of Women and Children, both those included in the group of civil and political rights as well as economic, educational, social, and cultural rights need to be pursued on an ongoing basis;

b. that in order to implement the fulfillment of all rights that must be possessed by Women and Children on an ongoing basis, a regulatory foundation is needed that is in accordance with the needs of the Region;

c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letters a and b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation on the Protection of Women and Children;

1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;

